<title>RUSSIA: Russian wage arrears rise in October.</title>
<headline>Russian wage arrears rise in October.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian wage arrears due to a lack of financing from the federal or regional governments rose to 7.87 trillion roubles on October 28 from 7.01 trillion roubles on September 23, the State Statistics Committee said.</p>
<p>    RUSSIAN WAGE ARREARS		Oct 28    Sept 23</p>
<p>    wage arrears (government)	  7,873	7,012</p>
<p>    wage arrears (companies)	  35,237     33,223</p>
<p>    wage arrears (total)		43,110     40,235</p>
<p>NOTE - figures in billions of roubles.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
